{
  "name": "Day 14 — Inbox AI: Classify + Sentiment + Reply Draft",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 14: Inbox AI: Classify + Sentiment + Reply Draft\n\n\n**Setup:**\n- Connect: Gmail (Google OAuth)\n- Connect: OpenAI API key\n- Connect: Telegram bot token (BotFather se)\n- Pehle ek test Gmail account par chalao\n\nCourse: Day 14 lesson page",
